<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/9/eng@/~cl_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The Private Employment Agencies Act 1981 [Act 246], which is referred to as the \"principal Act\" in this Act, is amended in section 3, in the definition of \"Director General\" by substituting for the words \"Director General of Manpower\" the words \"Director General of Labour\". Amendment of section 4"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/9/eng@> .
